<title>FINLAND: FINNISH COMPANIES' INTERIM RESULTS AND FORECASTS.</title>
<headline>FINNISH COMPANIES' INTERIM RESULTS AND FORECASTS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' forecasts for</p>
<p>Finnish companies' latest interim results, and published</p>
<p>earnings:</p>
<p>For most companies, figures are profit after financial</p>
<p>items, before extraordinary items and tax (for Nokia, profit</p>
<p>before tax and minorities).</p>
<p>For banks, figures are operating profit after credit losses.</p>
<p>The list will be updated as reports and forecasts are</p>
<p>published.</p>
<p>* denotes new entry.</p>
<p>(all figures million markka)</p>
